368
00:21:21,791 --> 00:21:23,666
Thanks for being with us today.
ຂອບໃຈທີ່ຢູ່ກັບພວກເຮົາມື້ນີ້.

369
00:21:24,875 --> 00:21:29,958
In 1996, you were arrested for
